title: A Second Bolshevik Attempt
subtitle: The Bolsheviks try again.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: dix >= 34 and bol_regime = 0 and vikzhel_deal = 0 and alt_coup_n < 3 and alt_coup_timer <= 0
priority: 45
on-arrival: {!
Q.alt_coup_n = (Q.alt_coup_n || 0) + 1;
Q.alt_coup_timer = 14;
Q.bol_power2 = Q.bolshevik + 0.5 * (RO.grievance(Q) - 55) - (Q.assembly_survives ? 8 : 0) - (Q.land_decree ? 5 : 0) - (Q.no_terror ? 4 : 0);
Q.bol_power2_d = Math.round(Q.bol_power2);
Q.coup2 = Q.bol_power2 >= 55 ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.coup2) {
    Q.bol_regime = 1;
    Q.assembly_survives = 0;
    Q.in_coalition = 0;
    Q.homogeneous_gov = 0;
    Q.bolshevik = 70;
    Q.repression = 4;
    Q.land_decree = 1;
    Q.soviet_democracy -= 15;
    RO.add(Q, {rel_bol: -6});
    Q.late_coup = 1;
    if (Q.at_war) { Q.at_war = 0; Q.late_peace = 1; RO.add(Q, {war_weariness: -15}); }
} else {
    Q.bolshevik -= 6;
    Q.soviet_democracy += 1;
}
!}
go-to: coup_yes if coup2 = 1; coup_no if coup2 = 0

@coup_yes

= The Bolsheviks Take Power

The hunger, the war weariness and the discontent in the factories have given the Bolsheviks a new opening. In a night of arrests, the Red Guards seized the government's offices and the Soviet executive. The Assembly was dissolved, by decree. [? if late_peace = 1 : The new government's first act was to ask Germany for peace, on any terms that Berlin would give. ?]

The experiment in democratic government is over. The party is now an opposition party in a one-party state, with a strong democratic past.

@coup_no

= The Bolsheviks Fail Again

The Bolsheviks tried again, in the factory districts, and the Soviet government prevailed. A mood of discontent has never been a plan, and the government has proven that it can hold its own. Their leaders are under arrest, or abroad.

*(The government's strength will be tested again.)*
